## Font & Typography for I18n

### Multi-Language Font Stack
```css
body {
  font-family: 
    /* Latin */
    "Inter", "Segoe UI", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif,
    /* Arabic */
    "Noto Sans Arabic",
    /* Japanese, Chinese, Korean */
    "Noto Sans JP", "Noto Sans SC", "Noto Sans KR",
    /* Devanagari (Hindi) */
