## Enterprise Forms & Validation

### Complex Form Patterns
| Pattern | Use Case | UX Benefit |
|---------|----------|------------|
| Wizard (Multi-Step) | User onboarding, long forms | Reduced cognitive load |
| Accordion | Grouped settings (expand on demand) | Scannability |
| Tabs | Distinct sections (Profile, Security, Notifications) | Organized |
| Modal | Quick edits without leaving page | Context preservation |

### Validation Strategy (Enterprise)
- **Client-Side**: Immediate feedback (format, required fields)
- **Server-Side**: Business rules (duplicate check, quota limits)
- **Debounced**: Validate on blur or 500ms after typing (not every keystroke)
- **Async Validation**: Username availability check (loading state)

